<title>CHINA: China province soybean output seen at 6.496 mln T.</title>
<headline>China province soybean output seen at 6.496 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's northeastern province of Heilongjiang is expected to harvest 6.496 million tonnes of soybeans in 1997, the Futures Herald said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Soybean output in the key producing province was 4.135 million tonnes in 1996, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>The total area planted with soybean was 3.02 million hectares this year compared with 2.16 million hectares last year, it said.</p>
<p>The newspaper linked the expected rise in output to rising soybean prices and declining corn prices this spring, but it gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
